	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Gratias ago immensas ob tam pretiosum munus, quod <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>misisti, neque potuisses convenientiorem materiam arripere nostro seculo <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ac etiam plausibiliorem papistis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Rogabo dominum, ut reliqua ea felicitate <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>absolvas et ecclesiae diu tuis scriptis prosis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Rependam brevi tuam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>liberalitatem munusculo aliquo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Mirum est apud nostros, quod vos <placeName ref="l587">Tigurini</placeName> in novum illud fędus nomen <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>vestrum dare non vultis.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Dicis: "Impius est rex, persequitur pios, comburit <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>multos innocuos."</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Verum est.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Cur Helveticum fędus non annihilatis?</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nolo camarinam.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Multi divinant non fore hoc absque seditione.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Filii huius seculi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>in sinu gaudent nos esse ita separatos, ut quęlibet civitas propriam sententiam <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>habeat.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">In fęderibus pangendis multa esse consideranda negat nemo; <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>sed tempora sunt perpendenda et quorundam vires auctas.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quid si aliquam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>conditionem possent civitates annectere, quo tandem persecutio cessaret in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quę fortassis ea ratione maior crudeliorque futura est?</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Dominus det nobis spiritum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>suum, ne quid agamus consultemusque contra illius verbum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName ref="p18538">Caesar</persName> agit <placeName ref="l1284">Bruxellę</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Do hat er sin son <persName>Philippum</persName> entpfangen.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Mann hat <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>im geschenckt mer dan fur 3 donen golds werden.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Consultat de rebus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Germanicis componendis.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">1. Maii erunt comitia <placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonę</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> et <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><persName ref="p4744">Fagio</persName> abierunt, puto in <placeName ref="l830">Angliam</placeName>; sibi ipsis fecerunt <placeName>Hispanicas</placeName> vestes, quo <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>minus agnoscantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Civitas consultat cum episcopo, quo modo commode possent <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Interim detestandum introducere sine tumultu.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Reliqui fratres adhuc haerent, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quid tum senatus sit acturus ignari.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Concionantur adhuc verbum dei et sacra<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>menta administrant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Dominus <persName>Michael</persName>, <persName>Augustinianę</persName> sectę monachus, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>qui concionatorem <placeName ref="l471">Spirę</placeName> egit, apud nos est et vix evasit Caesaris po<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>tentiam, et adhuc alii quidam fratres proscripti a papistis haerent apud <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nos ecclesiam expectantes ac legitimam vocationem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/><persName>Rusticus</persName> quidam in <placeName>Sungavia</placeName> in pago <placeName>Dunstat</placeName></foreign> hat ein gelten mit <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>win am hals gesetz, darin by 4 moß win gsin, die eim anderen buren <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>bracht, die uß gesoffen; ist also von stundt an beym tisch bliben ligen todt.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Disen hat der edelman lassen den hencker in <placeName ref="l2459">Rhin</placeName> werffen in eim <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>vas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Nihil respondes de causa divortii illius <persName ref="p8178">Thomę</persName>, qui monialem in <placeName ref="l2190">Seckingen</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>duxerat, quę adhuc a custodibus observatur.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Nebulo aliam superduxit et <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>omnem culpam huius divortii in te reiicit idque fecit coram senatu <placeName ref="l335">Milhusano</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Scribe igitur mihi rem ordine, quo te defendam, si noster senatus illum potuisset <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>comprehendere, facile credo, quod iam submersus esse[t] in flumine <placeName ref="l2459">Rheni</placeName> ob ductas <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>duas uxores.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandus</persName> hat ein zwifachen zuͦsatzs gen <placeName ref="l546">Wien</placeName> gethan, spist <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>die stat, fuͤrt vil geschutz dar, <foreign xml:lang="la">profant et munitiones; timet <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>absque dubio <placeName>Turicam</placeName> irruptionem.</foreign></s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="de"><persName>Margraff Albrecht</persName> vexiert die <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Seestett <foreign xml:lang="la">et <placeName ref="l749">Saxonicas</placeName> civitates.</foreign></s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="de">Ich bsorg, es werde ein grossen krieg <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>geben uff den sommer.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="de">Es kompt jetzs uff Georgij vil adels <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>in <placeName ref="l631">Burgundt</placeName> zuͦsamen, wiewol etlich sagen, sy kommen alle jar <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>do zuͦsamen.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Practica est multiplex; Satan non quiescit.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Caeterum dic, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>quando absolves tomum 2 Decadum tuarum?</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> valetudinar<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>ius est et senio confectus, aliquando delirat bonus pater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 8. Aprilis 1549.</s>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la">Raptim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la">Vigil<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>antissimo pastori D. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, praeceptori <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>suo perpetuo colendo.</s>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
